        {"event":"regroup","file":"voices/us/regroup-02.mp3","text":"Close it up! Regroup here!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"rallyHere","file":"voices/us/rally-here-01.mp3","text":"Rally here!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"rallyHere","file":"voices/us/rally-here-02.mp3","text":"This is our rally point!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"objectiveTaken","file":"voices/us/objective-taken-01.mp3","text":"We got it! Hold this ground!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"objectiveTaken","file":"voices/us/objective-taken-02.mp3","text":"Objective's ours! Dig in!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"objectiveLost","file":"voices/us/objective-lost-01.mp3","text":"We lost the position!","delivery":"combat"},
        {"event":"objectiveLost","file":"voices/us/objective-lost-02.mp3","text":"They took it! Fall back and regroup!","delivery":"combat"},
        {"event":"pushNow","file":"voices/us/push-now-01.mp3","text":"They're breaking! Push 'em!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"pushNow","file":"voices/us/push-now-02.mp3","text":"Move! Move! Don't let 'em settle!","delivery":"command"},
        {"event":"idleQuip","file":"voices/us/idle-quip-01.mp3","text":"When this is over, I'm sleeping for a week.","delivery":"idle"},
        {"event":"idleQuip","file":"voices/us/idle-quip-02.mp3","text":"I'd trade my rifle for a hot cup of coffee. Almost.","delivery":"idle"},
        {"event":"idleQuip","file":"voices/us/idle-quip-03.mp3","text":"If anybody sees my clean socks, tell 'em I miss 'em.","delivery":"idle"},
        {"event":"idleQuip","file":"voices/us/idle-quip-04.mp3","text":"Next fellow who says this is a short walk gets my pack.","delivery":"idle"},
        {"event":"idleQuip","file":"voices/us/idle-quip-05.mp3","text":"I swear this helmet gets heavier every mile.","delivery":"idle"},
        {"event":"idleStory","file":"voices/us/idle-story-01.mp3","text":"Back home my brother borrowed my good boots for one dance. Came home barefoot and swore a dog stole 'em. That dog must've known his size.","delivery":"story"},
        {"event":"idleStory","file":"voices/us/idle-story-02.mp3","text":"My old man said the Army would make a man outta me. First week I spent two hours peeling potatoes. Guess manhood comes with a paring knife.","delivery":"story"},
        {"event":"idleStory","file":"voices/us/idle-story-03.mp3","text":"Cook back at camp swore that stew was beef. I asked what part of the cow rattles when you stir it. He didn't think that was funny.","delivery":"story"},
        {"event":"idleStory","file":"voices/us/idle-story-04.mp3","text":"Buddy of mine once saluted a scarecrow at dawn. In his defense, the scarecrow had better posture than our lieutenant.","delivery":"story"},
        {"event":"idleStory","file":"voices/us/idle-story-05.mp3","text":"I wrote my girl I'd come home with medals. She wrote back she'd settle for me coming home with all my teeth. Fair bargain, I figure.","delivery":"story"},
        {"event":"idleLaugh","file":"voices/us/idle-laugh-01.mp3","text":"Ha! Ha ha!","delivery":"laugh"},
        {"event":"idleLaugh","file":"voices/us/idle-laugh-02.mp3","text":"Heh heh... that's awful.","delivery":"laugh"},
        {"event":"idleLaugh","file":"voices/us/idle-laugh-03.mp3","text":"Ha! You're full of it!","delivery":"laugh"},
        {"event":"idleLaugh","file":"voices/us/idle-laugh-04.mp3","text":"Oh, that's good. Ha ha!","delivery":"laugh"},
        {"event":"idleLaugh","file":"voices/us/idle-laugh-05.mp3","text":"Heh! Don't let the lieutenant hear that one.","delivery":"laugh"},
        {"event":"idleGroan","file":"voices/us/idle-groan-01.mp3","text":"Oh, come on. You've told that one three times.","delivery":"idle"},
        {"event":"idleGroan","file":"voices/us/idle-groan-02.mp3","text":"That's terrible. Tell it again.","delivery":"idle"}
      ]
